      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This appears to be triggered by Modular Avatar as Modular Avatar initializes Harmony, which creates one of these problem assemblies. However, in a blank worlds project, there are multiple assemblies which throw on `GetName`, and therefore will break depending on load order (notably, `UdonSharpRoslynCompileAssembly0` and `UdonSharpRoslynCompileAssembly1`, as well as `JetBrains.Rider.Unity.Editor.Plugin.Net46.Repacked` if Rider is selected as an external editor).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
